### Component 1: Public Complaint Portal (Frontend)

This is a **separate, unauthenticated page** at `/report` that any citizen can access. It is NOT behind the login wall.

#### [NEW] [PublicComplaintPage.tsx](file:///d:/MumbaiPolice_CyberFraud_Detection/frontend/src/pages/PublicComplaintPage.tsx)

A clean, mobile-friendly multi-step form with:

- **Step 1 — What happened?** (Fraud type dropdown, brief description, approximate amount lost)
- **Step 2 — Your Details** (Name, phone, email — minimal, just enough for contact)
