## Data Flow (End-to-End)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 👤 Citizen
    participant P as 🌐 Public Portal
    participant API as ⚙️ Backend API
    participant OCR as 🤖 Evidence Parser
    participant TRI as 📊 Auto-Triage
    participant OFF as 👮 Officer
    
    C->>P: Fill complaint form + upload evidence
    P->>API: POST /public/complaints (with files)
    API->>API: Generate tracking number (MH-PUB-2026-XXXXX)
    API-->>C: Return tracking number
    
    API->>OCR: Parse uploaded evidence (async worker)
    OCR->>OCR: OCR → Extract accounts, UPI, amounts
    OCR->>API: Return extracted_data + confidence
    
    API->>TRI: Run auto-triage
    TRI->>TRI: Check watchlist, score priority
    TRI->>TRI: Find best officer (workload + jurisdiction)
    TRI->>API: Assign officer + priority level
    
    API->>OFF: Send notification ("New complaint assigned")
    OFF->>API: GET /complaints (see queue)
    OFF->>OFF: Review evidence + extracted data
    OFF->>API: POST /complaints/{id}/approve
    API->>API: Convert complaint → Full Case
    API-->>C: Status updates to "Investigation Active"
```

