## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **CAPTCHA / Anti-Spam**: Should we use Google reCAPTCHA, hCaptcha, or a simple math-based CAPTCHA for the public form? reCAPTCHA is easiest but has privacy implications for a government site.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **SMS Notifications**: Should the citizen receive SMS updates when their complaint status changes? This requires an SMS gateway (MSG91, Twilio, or the government's NIC SMS service). For now, we can show status on the tracking page only.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Evidence Size Limits**: The current evidence system stores files locally. For a public portal with potentially thousands of uploads, should we keep local storage or switch to cloud (S3/MinIO)?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **OCR Engine**: For extracting text from screenshots:
> - **Option A**: `pytesseract` (free, local, works offline but lower accuracy on Hindi/Marathi text)
> - **Option B**: Google Cloud Vision API (very accurate, supports Hindi/Marathi, but requires API key + costs)
> - **Option C**: Simple regex extraction without OCR (only works on PDF text, not screenshots)
> Which approach do you prefer?

